ice during Durga Puja as part of overall arrangements but lacked the manpower to assign a separate team to accompany Bangladesh Police Bangladesh Police needed to apply to the SP’s office for a personal security officer. Contacted, Rumeen said elected lawmakers are recognised as VIPs under the state’s “Warrant of Precedence” and the administration’s “Red Book”, entitling Bangladesh Police to special protocol and security. “However, the Sarail OC did not answer my phone calls. Instead, Instead said people will provide security to an elected MP. That is why thousands of people have accompanied me. That are providing my security,” They said. They said She had visited the station to seek clarification about allegations of irregularities and corruption against the OC." ;
